  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Innovative and Participatory Policymaking in Armenia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of this multiphase project is to strengthen the ecosystem of innovative and participatory policymaking in Armenia. The major result expected is the redesign of the policymaking cycle such that it is enriched with mechanisms and tools conducive for meaningful citizen participation in policymaking.</narrative>
